      <title>据说台湾竞标者是盘旋AMD的ZT服务器资产</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-15/taiwan-bidders-are-said-to-be-circling-amd-s-zt-server-assets</link>
      <description><![CDATA[据知情人士称，Compal Electronics Inc.，Wistron Corp.会员Wiwynn Corp.和US Company Jabil Inc.设定为Advanced Micro Devices Inc.的AI服务器组装工厂提交修订的优惠。]]></description>
